r Membership','','publish','closed','closed','','your-membership','','','2025-06-09 22:14:52','2025-06-09 13:14:52','',50,'https://lvh.me/register/your-membership/',0,'page','',0),(53,1,'2025-06-09 22:14:52','2025-06-09 13:14:52','[rcp_profile_editor]','Edit Your Profile','','publish','closed','closed','','edit-your-profile','','','2025-06-09 22:14:52','2025-06-09 13:14:52','',50,'https://lvh.me/register/edit-your-profile/',0,'page','',0),(54,1,'2025-06-09 22:14:52','2025-06-09 13:14:52','[rcp_update_card]','Update Billing Card','','publish','closed','closed','','update-billing-card','','','2025-06-09 22:14:52','2025-06-09 13:14:52','',50,'https://lvh.me/register/update-billing-card/',0,'page','',0),(55,1,'2025-06-09 22:37:07','2025-06-09 13:37:07','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WordPress へようこそ。こちらは最初の投稿です。編集または削除し、コンテンツ作成を始めてください。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Hello world!','','inherit','closed','closed','','1-revision-v1','','','2025-06-09 22:37:07','2025-06-09 13:37:07','',1,'https://lvh.me/?p=55',0,'revision','',0),(57,1,'2025-12-27 11:41:34','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','自動下書き','','auto-draft','open','open','','','','','2025-12-27 11:41:34','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://lvh.me/?p=57',0,'post','',0);
